The only 60$ scroll is enchant weapon.
The only 80$ scrolls are enchant armor and remove curse.

So if you have three differents scrolls in the 60-80$ range, one of them  
is bound to be remove curse.
If you own the scroll and have a shop at hand, you can remove the doubt  
over the price (by (not) selling/taking it back sufficiently many time to  
have 2 prices offered).
So that reduce the set to 2 scrolls, which is better than three (of  
course, you might want to spend enchant weapon on excalibur...)

If wielded, a uncursed scroll of RC is enough, but of course you might  
want to take the occasion to remove curse from all your gear.
And if it's not RC, then blessed is better...

When reading hte 'random' scrolls, be sure to wield a weapon you want to  
enchant and wear only a piece of armor you want to enchant so that the  
scroll is not wasted...

